; @brief  Harvest sprite cave (fAreaEvents_ImpsUnderground, event3 bit $2000): a harvest sprite shows the sickle he made and
;         asks whether the player uses it (dialogs $0325-$032A). Confidence: medium (derived from the dialogs, flags and
;         callers).
; @bank   $B4   (AI byte code; script id $15, slot table generated by tools/ai/aidata.py from defs/ai/scripts.json)
; @see    script_14 docs/ai/commands.md
;;



